== Trivia ==
* Before [[Booster Pack #3]], Locust of War was named Locust of Wrath. Unlike other Locusts, the name of Locust of Wrath was from one of seven Deadly Sins instead of four Harbingers. This is why the Steam achievement still reads as such.

